    "sentence_translations": [
      "(5) Really Nice to Meet You",
      "",
      "The male student is holding up an umbrella for Leng Xiaoxi.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi feels a little embarrassed. She says, “Thank you for holding up the umbrella for me.”",
      "",
      "The male student also feels a little embarrassed. He says, “No … no need to thank me!”",
      "",
      "“What is your name?” Leng Xiaoxi asks.",
      "",
      "“Gao Ming,” the male student says.",
      "",
      "“Really nice to meet you. My name is Leng Xiaoxi.”",
      "",
      "“Meeting you, I’m also really happy. Really … really happy!” Gao Ming says.",
      "",
      "“What are you studying?” Leng Xiaoxi asks.",
      "",
      "“I’m studying medicine, in Year 3. And … and you?” Gao Ming asks.",
      "",
      "“I … I also am … studying medicine,” Leng Xiaoxi says.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi thinks, “What should I say? I’m no longer studying at Xijing University. I’m now working. Should I say it like this?",
      "Then how come I can be inside the school? I used my junior schoolmate’s student card. Should I say it like this?”"
    ]
